---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Security — Backplane" description="Security information for Backplane.">
  <main class="legal-document-page">
    <h1>Security</h1>
    <p>Backplane is open-source software. Please report security issues in the source repository so maintainers can investigate and coordinate a fix.</p>
    <p>When using an optional hosted or relay service, report service-specific issues to that service operator and review its security documentation.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/i2cjak/Backplane/security" rel="noopener noreferrer">Backplane security advisories</a></p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/i2cjak/Backplane/blob/t3cad/LICENSE" rel="noopener noreferrer">Backplane MIT license</a></p>
  </main>
</Layout>
